Babel North Star desktop implementation

This source increment was created for the owner of the Babel project from the
supplied BabelTuiNorthStar.png. The Babel name and logo are retained from that
reference. The included logo crop and reference image are not newly designed
or independently relicensed branding assets.

Linux packaged builds include the @napi-rs/keyring native binding. Its platform
package contains LICENSE.third-party.md, including notices for the statically
linked libdbus (AFL-2.1 OR GPL-2.0-or-later) and other bundled dependencies.

New implementation source is provided under Apache-2.0. This package is not an
upstream Babel release and contains no model provider credentials or font files.
